        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9025/457, 18 Inch New Yorker Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe New Yorker 18 Inch Cabinet Pull is a great, modern pull for any kitchen remodel. The rectangular shape is accentuated by the contemporary finishes. Choose from any of 6 beautiful and modern finish colors. This 18 Inch New Yorker Cabinet Door Pull is easy to install--it comes with all the necessary mounting hardware. Better yet, it can be used all over your home. Update your dresser, add a modern point of interest to your entertainment stand, or even use in on the bathroom vanity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9025\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-4-inch-mid-century-modern-cabinet-hardware-omnia-9025-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-6-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-8-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-10-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/new-yorker-12-inch-cabinet-pull-omnia-9025-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9025 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
